     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "The function call <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">plt.scatter(x, y)</code> creates a scatter plot based on the data stored in the variables <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">x</code> and <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">y</code>."
